WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.180
See which leases end soon and their notice dates, then send the tenant a renewal offer.

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:15.040
Renewals shows the leases ending soon, the notice deadlines and the offers waiting for an answer.

3
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.030
Look three, six, twelve or twenty-four months ahead.

4
00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.670
To offer a renewal, open the lease.

5
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:32.370
In the Renewal card, choose Offer a renewal.

6
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:37.550
Offer a new lease, or an extension of this one.

7
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:43.100
Set how many months, the new rent and the yearly increase.

8
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:54.900
Send it now through the tenant portal, where they can accept it.

9
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.170
Choose Make the offer.

10
00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:07.930
The offer waits here with its status. When it is accepted, the lease is extended or a new one is drafted for you.
